WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Great, we have some time. Let's not waste it.

2
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:13.000
I think very soon a whole army of Architects will be here.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:19.000
We have to seal the portal. We cannot let them break into our world!

4
00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:25.000
The spell requires long preparation, and we will need protection. Be prepared to anything.

5
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.500
May the Light be with us!

6
00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:43.500
Invasion. Chaos. Disgusting.

7
00:00:43.500 --> 00:00:48.500
What the... Kill this monster before it's too late!

8
00:00:48.500 --> 00:00:52.500
The portal will not close while it's still alive!

9
00:00:52.500 --> 00:00:57.500
Enjoy your advantage. It will not last.

10
00:00:57.500 --> 00:01:03.500
You all will be transmuted. Soon...
